{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39538","headline":"南康夜宴东溪留别郡守陆郎中 · 张蠙","name":"南康夜宴东溪留别郡守陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘然野客才无取，多谢君侯独见知。\n竹叶樽前教驻乐，桃花纸上待君诗。\n香迷蛱蝶投红烛，舞拂蒹葭倚翠帷。\n明发别愁何处去，片帆天际酒醒时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}